flowchart TD
    A[👀 Viewer Logs In] --> B[🏠 Dashboard<br>All Widgets Visible, Buttons Greyed Out]
    
    B --> C{Navigate}
    
    C -->|Check Ledger| D1[👥 Open Customers]
    D1 --> D2[📖 View Ledger]
    D2 --> D3[❌ 'Add Transaction' Button is DISABLED]
    
    C -->|Check Reports| E1[📊 Open Reports]
    E1 --> E2[📈 View P&L / Balance Sheet]
    E2 --> E3[📤 Export PDF (Download Allowed)]
    
    C -->|Check Inventory| F1[📦 Open Products]
    F1 --> F2[📋 View Stock & Prices]
    F2 --> F3[❌ 'Add Product' Button is DISABLED]
    
    D3 --> G[🔚 End]
    E3 --> G
    F3 --> G
    
    note right of D2
        🚫 All + / Edit / Delete buttons are hidden.
        🚫 Cannot change settings.
        🚫 Cannot send reminders.
        ✅ Can only view and export reports.
    end note
    
    style D3 fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#b71c1c
    style F3 fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#b71c1c